WEBVTT

00:09:26.384 --> 00:09:30.464
We are left alone with our day,

00:09:30.464 --> 00:09:35.941
and the solutions of the future will be harder won.

00:09:35.941 --> 00:09:38.726
God knows, we don't lack for the challenges.

00:09:38.726 --> 00:09:39.880
Thank you very much.

00:09:39.880 --> 00:09:45.880
(Applause)